WEBVTT

00:00:00.513 --> 00:00:02.863
<v><b>Detective:</b></v> Where were you at seven o’clock last night?

00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:04.257
<v><b>Jason:</b></v> I was at home.

00:00:04.457 --> 00:00:09.362
<v><b>Detective:</b></v> You weren’t at home. Your wife says you were out. She was at home alone.

00:00:09.748 --> 00:00:13.778
<v><b>Jason:</b></v> Oh yes, I remember now. I was in a pub.

00:00:14.318 --> 00:00:15.391
<v><b>Detective:</b></v> Were you alone?

00:00:15.685 --> 00:00:22.232
<v><b>Jason:</b></v> No, I wasn’t. I was with a friend. Kevin Smith. You can ask him.